{"4699680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravesong: Litany of Ashes", "steam_appid": 4699680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4868320], "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy story-driven FPS RPGs with strong atmosphere and focused design, <strong>add the game to your wishlist and follow its development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to deliver a memorable experience — not a marathon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/255071d41a8e378cc7b5c6711ee6d6f0.poster.avif?t=1786867846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/255071d41a8e378cc7b5c6711ee6d6f0.webm?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/255071d41a8e378cc7b5c6711ee6d6f0.mp4?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>Gameplay</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person action RPG</strong> focused on tight, handcrafted experiences rather than an open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a series of dungeon-like chapters, each designed as a self-contained narrative and combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the intensity and weight of modern action RPGs, the game is structured around linear, story-driven environments instead of sprawling open-world exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon features its own puzzles, and you will need to discover how to traverse and survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/5e514553f401df1ff6073876c7e6f568.poster.avif?t=1786867846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/5e514553f401df1ff6073876c7e6f568.webm?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/5e514553f401df1ff6073876c7e6f568.mp4?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Player Experience</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, close-range combat that feels intense and grounded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration through eerie, carefully crafted locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three intertwined stories, each following a different character as their paths slowly connect</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>CHAPTERS</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own set of chapters. The story begins with Aric, then continues with Rina, and finally concludes with Merius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/e65fe1c1d56494d8919ff71df9af445f.poster.avif?t=1786867846\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/e65fe1c1d56494d8919ff71df9af445f.webm?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/extras/e65fe1c1d56494d8919ff71df9af445f.mp4?t=1786867846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story told across three intertwined perspectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aric. Rina. Merius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One converging timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each perspective reveals a different piece of the same truth—leading all characters to the same moment, the same place, and the same breaking point.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story told across three intertwined perspectives:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aric. Rina. Merius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One converging timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each perspective reveals a different piece of the same truth—leading all characters to the same moment, the same place, and the same breaking point.</p>", "short_description": "A story-driven RPG told across three intertwined perspectives - Aric fighting monsters born from the darkness, Rina struggling against savage tribes, and Merius trapped in cycles of countless lives he can no longer fully remember - as a growing shadow spreads through the world, twisting everything.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/43497ebab821f39e038bd9ece0e270b182e38ed3/header.jpg?t=1786867846", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/ecccc9d0f08abd871db1d80628bd408676cf4fd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786867846", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4699680/ecccc9d0f08abd871db1d80628bd408676cf4fd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786867846", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700HQ 2.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>O